    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17519,
        "title": "Creazione di oggetti",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148559,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Supponiamo di avere due variabili, <code>playerName</code> e <code>playerHealth</code>, entrambe relative allo stesso giocatore.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Nova&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>playerName</code>, seguito da <code>playerHealth</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148560,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Invece di usare due variabili separate per descrivere il nostro giocatore, possiamo raggrupparle in un'unica variabile, nota come <strong>oggetto</strong>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Nova&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>player</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148561,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Creiamo gli oggetti in modo simile alle variabili, con la parola chiave <code>const</code> seguita da un nome, da un segno di uguale e da parentesi graffe <code>{}</code>. Ad esempio, <code>const player = {};</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>, seguito da <code>player</code> e poi <code>=</code>, <code>{}</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148562,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le informazioni all'interno di un oggetto sono note come <strong>proprietà</strong> dell'oggetto. Le proprietà vanno all'interno delle parentesi graffe <code>{}</code> dell'oggetto.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Nova&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>{</code>, seguito da <code>name: \"Nova\"</code> e infine <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148563,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Creiamo le proprietà iniziando con un nome, seguito da due punti <code>:</code> e da un valore, come <code>health: 100</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>health</code>, seguito da <code>:</code> e infine <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148564,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa segue il segno di uguale quando creiamo un nuovo oggetto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Parentesi graffe <code>{}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Parentesi <code>()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Parentesi graffe <code>{}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148565,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Raggruppa la proprietà nell'oggetto <code>player</code>.</p><code name=\"script1.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Nova&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>{</code>, seguito da <code>name:</code> e poi <code>\"Nova\"</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148566,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come chiamiamo le informazioni contenute tra le parentesi graffe <code>{}</code> di un oggetto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Le proprietà dell'oggetto</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Le variabili dell'oggetto</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Le proprietà dell'oggetto.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148567,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando creiamo una proprietà, cosa mettiamo tra il nome e il valore?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Due punti <code>:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Una virgola <code>,</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Due punti <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148568,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assembla il codice per creare un oggetto.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = { } ;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>, seguito da <code>enemy</code> e poi <code>=</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148569,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea un oggetto nemico con la proprietà <code>name: \"Slime\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>, seguito da <code>enemy</code> e poi <code>=</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>name: \"Slime\"</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148570,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come chiamiamo un gruppo di contenuti correlati raggruppati in un'unica variabile?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un oggetto</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Una variabile impostata</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un oggetto.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148571,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assegna al giocatore la proprietà <code>score</code> con valore <code>0</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"26\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>score: 0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17520,
        "title": "Proprietà degli oggetti",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148572,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per aggiungere altre proprietà a un oggetto, inizia con una virgola, poi aggiungi la proprietà.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"54\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"className\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Archer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>,</code>, seguito da <code>className: \"Archer\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148573,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un oggetto può avere tutte le proprietà che vuoi, purché ogni proprietà sia separata da una virgola.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"className\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Archer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>,</code>, seguito da <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148574,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le proprietà degli oggetti possono essere numeri, stringhe, valori booleani, array o persino altri oggetti. <br /><br />Imposta la proprietà <code>health</code> dell'oggetto sul numero <code>100</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"79\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"className\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Archer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148575,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare <code>console.log()</code> per visualizzare il contenuto del nostro oggetto <code>player</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"103\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"className\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Archer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>console.log</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>player</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148576,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Accediamo alla proprietà di un oggetto usando il nome dell'oggetto, un <code>.</code> e il nome della proprietà, come in <code>player.health</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"109\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"className\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Archer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player.health);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>player</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e infine <code>health</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148577,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dopo aver effettuato l'accesso al valore di una proprietà, possiamo aggiornarlo usando un segno di uguale. Ad esempio, prova a scrivere <code>player.health = 80</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"101\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"className\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Archer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.health = \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>player.health = 80</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148578,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa va inserito tra una proprietà e l'altra?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Una virgola <code>,</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Niente</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Una virgola <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148579,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizzerà <code>console.log(myObject)</code> per l'oggetto <code>myObject</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">L'oggetto e le sue proprietà</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo il nome dell'oggetto</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">L'oggetto e le sue proprietà.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148580,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inserisci la virgola mancante tra le proprietà dell'oggetto.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148581,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Visualizza <code>health</code> dell'oggetto <code>enemy</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;type&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"101\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"speed\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"aggressive\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemy.health);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>enemy</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e infine <code>health</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148582,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa mettiamo dopo il nome dell'oggetto per accedere a una proprietà?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un punto <code>.</code> e il nome della proprietà</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un punto interrogativo <code>?</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un punto <code>.</code> e il nome della proprietà.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148583,
